			"notes": "Updated to version 3.0.0! \n\n- Now using Cardinal Componets API to store the color information as NBT\n- Overhauld the API, to make it better and cleaner, as a result it breaks with older versions\n- Added support for custom color animations using datapacks!\n- Added support for permissions to execute the commands!\n- Changed the chat messages, and the mod prefix!\n\nAPI changes are detailed in the javadoc. The TL;DR is: to set a color use #setColor() for entities & entity type, get it using the get counterpart. \n\nSelect the +nocca file if you already use CardinalComponetsAPI in your mod/modpack! (The required modules are: base, entity, scoreboard)"
